<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai authorities are now deploying AI-powered surveillance to target smuggling syndicates, while police in Chiang Rai seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck. Floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households, a lower death toll than the 76 reported earlier. The fruit sector’s labour shortage has led the government to plan hiring workers from Sri Lanka for the first time. A crackdown on cross-border financial scams resulted in 39 arrests and the seizure of THB500 million in assets. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/15/thailand-bangkok-protesters-decry-imf-and-world-bank-warn-of-destructive-capitalism&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPNWVnc250a2xFSHNqSXFJU1pNWXB6Y3pFWk9jeHVYcW00bUhYSkt5QzFjeXdSRmdHaHlDcDNWNXMtWHQtb1Z2aDBOS2ptVjNTQ3NOQkh5eGNTaXlpbks2bklROE1VU3lBQ1VfaVlNRkNtTkZ0REdMenVHYmQ1YUd6R2xKbXFIcTdyYmlKNXIwb0ItUk5OdzdhNkZTMDF5SjEyLTN3SHBOLW5uWGptTzJsdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thailand Business News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1Zc2NCNEtJNWY3ZmkxUzZvS0R3M084TV9XWDN1X0w3ODZtbV9TN0MzamZLUENfU0Q1TUFXSHFCMzVJY3RJa01LWThnd2xOajQy?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Edge Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Armagh I&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPUW9VSlAwOXBoalVpa0tXU2pvYUFxYnJFelZVdWV6Vl9EWTFIOHpreVBaV2tQNmxTWTVIYjNKM011REdmNG51WGZGZTdmcjlSbzFIck9SOG16aXZ4Y1IzNWtTN3g3Nk16aV9oemtlWnVsSXVuTVB1aXVqTkpUeGoyQ3RWekNqZmZsVUltNkM5ZG5sSHhlU3JWQkhTeDh6T0xiSG9XeUgxZFJVdFYzTXB1eHM2dWRhTzlBbFZZemxIenpEQjlmV1BqcTF3eHRxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Straits Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPdWkwOU